sentences.l:
Now the gods, seated beside Zeus, were in assembly
on a golden floor, and among them lady Hebe
nectar was pouring out as wine;

sentences.t:
δαιμονίη τί νύ σε Πρίαμος Πριάμοιό τε παῖδες
τόσσα κακὰ ῥέζουσιν, ὅ τ’ ἀσπερχὲς μενεαίνεις
Ἰλίου ἐξαλαπάξαι ἐϋκτίμενον πτολίεθρον;

sentences.l:
Whenever I too, eager, a city to plunder utterly,
the one I wish, where men dear to you are born,
not at all to delay my anger, but to let me;

Like a star which the son of Cronus of crooked cunning sent,
either a portent to sailors or to a wide army of people,
bright;
